WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.250
What should I do?

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.270
I can't really think of anything...

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.390
Oh, I know.

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.920
I think I'll take care of my errand, first.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.900
Buy me some root beer and kaki-peanuts from the shop in front of the train station.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.860
After that, I think I'll go to the arcade.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.810
Oh, Guan Yu-sama, what
a foolish young lad I am!

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.290
I acquired my greatly desired figurines,

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.530
and yet I feign ignorance at
Kiyoshi-dono's abject plight.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.540
What a...

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.210
What a coward I am!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.500
As it stands, yours truly is no better than
the infamous traitors Lü Bu and Wei Yan!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.260
What is yours truly to do?!

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.120
Guan Yu-sama!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.060
Damn it!

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.400
Guess I'll go now. Though it's still kinda early...

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.820
Giving up already?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.700
Kinda wimpy, aren't you?

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.480
I'm just a bit rusty, since I haven't played this in a while.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.390
Huh?

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.120
Isn't that one of our school uniforms?

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.540
You go to Hachi-ko, too?

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.790
Girls like her don't usually go there, though.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.860
What are you doing here?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.010
I thought all of you boys were in prison, weren't you?

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.890
I'm out because the Underground Student Council asked me

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.020
to run an errand for them.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.310
You keep talking to me like we're on equal terms,

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.990
but I'm a 2nd-year.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.060
You have to address
your elders more politely.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.520
Shut up...

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.550
What's wrong? Your face is beet red.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.900
No it's not!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.030
Ah, aren't you cheeky?

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.360
Especially for someone who blushes at just a peek of cleavage.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.110
Huh?! I wasn't looking!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.170
Anzu! Let's take some print club pics!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.030
Coming!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.700
I'll take you on anytime, Kouhai.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:18.210
I've got the number-one ranking here.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.630
See you around, Kouhai.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:26.200
That was the first time I really got to talk to a girl since I enrolled here.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.590
I wonder if she always
hangs out at the arcade.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.390
How was it, being outside
again after so long?

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.100
Thank you very much.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.480
Nothing beats the freedom of being outside, all right.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.930
Did you buy what I asked you to?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.840
Yes, it's in the refrigerator.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.610
Um...

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.190
Will I ever be allowed to go out again?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:48.740
That depends on how well you do your job.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.200
Damn it!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.390
Why, you!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.410
I'm sorry! I ran back here!

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:55.670
For crying out loud!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.080
Root beer is carbonated!

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.680
What are you waiting for?!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.670
Get back to work!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.040
Yes!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.650
Depends on how well I do my job?

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:08.000
But there's not much else I can report, is there?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.180
Huh? What's that?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.710
A toy sword?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.030
All right, that should be good enough.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.890
What are you using the kaki-peanuts for?

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.280
Watch and learn.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.980
Chicken?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:31.910
You mean...

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.240
Is that...?

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.360
Ow!

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.410
It's dangerous to be frying dressed like that!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.370
By using kaki-peanuts as breading,

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.670
the chicken doesn't absorb the seasoning,

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.210
and you get a nice crunchiness.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.300
It looks good.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.130
It <i>is</i> good.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:52.500
Hot!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.850
It's too hot right out of the fryer!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.140
You have to let it cool down!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.230
So, do you have any new
information on the prisoners?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.690
Um, well, not really...

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.530
If not, then you don't get any.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.650
Aw, man...

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:09.730
Some sort of information...

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.780
Come to think of it...

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.850
What's that?

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:15.370
Well...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.450
I'm not too sure, myself.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.830
It was in the restrooms next to the field.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.040
Don't make me touch something you found in the restroom!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.410
I'm sorry!

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.880
You're not getting any karaage for <i>that</i> kind of information!

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.630
It's gone... It's gone...!

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:34.130
The tip of the Green Dragon Crescent Blade,

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:37.390
synonymous with Guan Yu for slaying so many of his mighty foes, is nowhere to be found!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.020
Where on earth is it?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.890
Ah, I should have kept a closer eye on it while I was gazing upon it earlier!

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.520
What are you doing? Gross!

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.020
Oh, er, I dropped my glasses...

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.730
so I was looking for them...

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.930
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.860
Get back to work at once.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.870
Help yourselves.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.220
Today we have genmaicha.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.900
And to go along with it,

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.000
I've prepared kaki-peanuts as a snack.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:05.500
These are...

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:10.180
Tsuruta persimmon seed-shaped snacks made from Uonuma-grown rice crackers, right?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.760
Leave it to you, President. Well spotted.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:16.140
Nothing beats Tsuruta kaki-peanuts.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.040
Oh, come to think of it,

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.140
that "yours truly" guy was fumbling
around the restroom for something.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:24.210
Hmph, probably crapping himself again.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:28.780
Vice President, do not use such vulgar terms during teatime.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.980
Please excuse me!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.860
What is this?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.290
Do you know what this is?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.230
No.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.940
That's the toy that Shingo said
he found lying in the restroom!

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:42.040
I'll never admit the truth about that!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.290
It appears to be a Green Dragon Crescent Blade.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.530
Green Dragon Crescent Blade...?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:48.040
In simple terms, a Chinese sword.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.630
It appears to be a miniature.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:52.550
Huh? Why would it be mixed in with the kaki-peanuts?

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.320
You should file a claim.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.320
A Chinese sword?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.680
A Green Dragon Crescent Blade...

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:03.820
China...

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.520
And...

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.440
Dirty Four-eyes, looking for
something in the restroom...

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.070
Off-campus permission?

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.760
That's right. Go enjoy yourself again.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.390
Thank you very much.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.700
But, did I even do anything?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.110
You've done a <i>very</i> good job.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:32.630
Where's Gakuto?

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.750
He said he didn't want
to come outside today.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.610
He seems depressed lately, doesn't he?

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:38.980
Did something happen?

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.720
He doesn't answer any of my questions.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.810
Whither is my Green Dragon Crescent Blade?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.690
Imagine, the sword that I put in my mouth,

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.380
thinking it was a kaki-peanut,

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:53.160
will end up being the rope that hangs them.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.050
I will allow you to handle this.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.500
Thank you very much.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.110
Incidentally, from where did you obtain that?

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.450
From the rest—

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.480
Rest?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.620
I mean, fr-fr-from Shingo,

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.750
who I have handily spying
on the rest of them.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.780
Is that right?

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.580
Quite the useful spy you have there.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.690
Absolutely right.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.550
I have to take this secret
to the grave with me!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:23.300
She's not here today, huh?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.850
Why are you spacing out?

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.120
You'll get beaten.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.480
Come on, don't take your eyes off of her.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:38.200
Aww, you really are lame at this.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:38.690
She's so close!

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.610
Her boobs are touching me!

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.220
You got sent on another errand by
the Underground Student Council?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.990
Yeah. I have to go buy some root beer after this.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.720
Don't go to the arcade first, you dummy.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.280
Oh, shut up. It doesn't
make any difference.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.250
Well, let's get going.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.960
I've got time. I'll go with you.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:01.380
Here you go.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.250
My treat.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.120
Thanks.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:05.600
You know,

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.490
the Underground Student Council must really trust you.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:10.730
I'm a model prisoner, after all.

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.060
Funny, you don't look like a model prisoner.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.690
If you ask me, you look like a Yankee.

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:16.400
Yeah, well.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.570
Anzu-san, the same goes for you.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:20.820
I get that a lot!

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:24.890
Hey, let me have a bite.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:25.450
Huh?

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.660
Here, you can try mine, too.

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.740
Er, uh...

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.000
Ah, the chocolate is pretty good, too.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:37.870
Man, she's licking it all over!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:41.260
It's okay to lick Anzu's ice cream, right?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.760
She's not going to yell "Ew!" or anything, is she?

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.130
Now that I think of it,

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.970
I've got these tickets.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.320
Movie tickets?

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.600
"The Grapes of Wrath."

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:54.100
What, do grapes grow giant-sized, get mad, and attack people?

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.570
Hmm, probably something like that, I guess.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.730
A B-grade horror flick maybe?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.570
I got them for free, so I don't really know, either.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:03.270
Want to go see it?

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.300
Oh, I don't have time today.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.430
Man, you're so unsociable.

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:09.990
Sorry. I wish I could go, but...

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.320
Here, hold my ice cream.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.620
O-Okay.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.460
You're a model prisoner, right?

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.090
You'll be let out again.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:24.390
This movie's playing until next week.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.630
Yeah, but I don't know when I'll be let out again.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:28.790
On the day they'll let you out,

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.560
put this on the prison
barricade during lunch,

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.930
and I'll make sure to be at the arcade.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.560
Don't lose it now, Model Prisoner.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.330
Okay.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.450
You will now get a five-minute break!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.260
But first, line up!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.990
Since you've been doing
such good work lately,

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.890
the president has a reward for you.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:47.490
You should be glad.

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:49.910
Next! Hold out your hand.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.490
Huh? Just one?

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:52.910
Got a problem with that?

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.370
No, thanks for the food.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.310
You get one, too.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.500
Much obliged.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.050
Oh, pardon me, pardon me.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.590
That goes with <i>this</i>...

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.010
Doesn't it, Dirty Four-eyes?!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.100
What... might... that... be...?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.010
You're such a big fan of the Three Kingdoms,

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:16.020
and yet you're saying you don't recognize Guan Yu?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.420
Yours truly does indeed recognize him,

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.110
but he has no interest in figurines.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:23.020
Ho, is that right?

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:25.650
Kiyoshi, does this belong to you?

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.420
No, it doesn't.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.010
I see, so neither of you knows about this?

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.340
So it would appear.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:33.160
That can't possibly be true!

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.600
I checked, and this figurine
is a limited edition,

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.490
that could have only been acquired in Akiba on Saturday, May 7th!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:41.030
That was the day of the track meet—

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.460
The day that Kiyoshi broke out!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.170
You had Kiyoshi buy this figurine for you in exchange
for assistance with his escape, didn't you?!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.930
Gakuto-kun helped with the breakout?

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:53.680
That's how badly you wanted this figurine, wasn't it?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.590
Look, Dirty Four-eyes,

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.310
if you will admit that this figurine is yours,

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.440
I'll give it back.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.300
No, Gakuto!

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:05.790
If you admit that the figurine is yours,

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.990
you'll also admit to helping me break out!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.160
And if you do that,

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.200
everyone's sentence will be extended again!

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:14.450
Come to think of it, there was a horse figurine included with it.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.120
Let's see...

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:19.580
I think I'll try riding it, myself.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.170
This is quite a comfortable ride.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.760
Hya... Hya...

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:32.930
Damn it, does she know what Gakuto had to go through to get that figurine?!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:34.970
Gakuto's whole adolescence.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.930
That figurine only goes on
sale once every four years.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.860
He also ruined his three
years of high school.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.640
Seven years of his life
are tied to that figurine!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:42.120
And she's...!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.350
Hya... Hya...

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:45.650
What's wrong? You're sweating like crazy.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.650
Well then, why don't I ride
double with Guan Yu now?

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:49.610
Double?!

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.620
Hya! Hya!

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.120
If she keeps this up, his Guan Yu figurine will break!

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.170
Here's to working with you, my brothers!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.720
Yeah!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.930
Let us now work together to save those who are in distress!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.740
While we may not have been born on the same day...

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.060
We shall die on the same day!

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.070
We shall... die... on the same day...

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.650
Hya! Hya! Hya!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:32.160
Hya!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.400
Gakuto! That's enough!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.120
Admit that it's your figurine!

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:37.700
Hya! Hya!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.410
If you won't do it, then I—

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.500
Good, Gakuto.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.460
That's better.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:53.170
Then Gakuto-kun really did...

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.900
President, as you can see,

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:59.680
Dirty Four-eyes admits that he assisted with the breakout.

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:00.680
So it would seem.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:04.410
Which now means that their
crime is even more serious—

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.400
What are you...?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.490
As I told you earlier...

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:24.330
Yours truly is not interested in these toys.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:27.210
Our break time has ended.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.340
I will be going back to work now.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.550
I'll be taking a kaki-peanut, as well.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.080
Are you sure about this?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.260
It was for the best.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.310
But, you tied your whole
adolescence to that figurine.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.600
If I had ended up selling our friendship for a figurine,

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.940
I would not be able to face Guan Yu-sama.

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.690
I should have done this sooner.

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:57.420
Yours truly very nearly cast not just a mere seven years, but a whole life away into the sewer.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:14:59.450
Gakuto...

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.390
Kiyoshi-dono...

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.390
I'm sorry for everything that I've done.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:06.330
For feigning ignorance of the bullying you have endured.

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:10.920
I shall never again conduct myself
in such a dastardly manner as this.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:13.560
You idiot.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.790
You don't have a single thing to apologize to me for.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.830
Kiyoshi-dono...

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:25.890
It appears that your plan to get Four-eyes to admit complicity in the breakout plan has failed.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.090
I am terribly sorry.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.100
I never expected him to go that far.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.590
I'm sorry! I'm so late!

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:35.440
I put the root beer in the fridge

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.440
Isn't this the toy sword I picked up in the restroom?

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.410
What did you... just say?

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:44.660
Huh?

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:46.370
I picked this up in the restroom,

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.040
and gave it to the vice president.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.330
Right, Vice President?

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:52.960
No, President, you see...

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:56.550
President!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.010
President, are you all right?

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:06.060
I apologize profusely for this indiscretion!

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:09.060
I am prepared to accept any punishment you wish!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.760
It's all right.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.940
Please lift your head.

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:13.310
I couldn't possibly!

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.400
Please punish me in any way you see fit!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.270
I was also unwise to give
you this assignment.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:26.080
Huh? Dirty Four-eyes
smashed the figurine?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.500
Yes. And we were one inch away, too.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.230
Hmm... But how did it end up that way?

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:32.710
I am the one to blame!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:36.170
President, please punish my arrogant self!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.550
Here, use this crop,

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.730
and spank me, please!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:40.880
I beg you!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.590
Hana, this herb tea is very good.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.600
Huh? Thank you very much.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.240
What kind of herbs are in it?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.380
Well, um...

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.440
Lemongrass and hibiscus, I think.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.110
I think I'll have another cup.

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.030
Okay.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:01.910
Um, what will we do for our next operation?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.370
Next...

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:07.310
I will personally assume command.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.410
I deeply apologize for the
commotion this has created!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.840
The vice president was correct.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:17.170
Out of his desire for a Guan Yu figurine, yours truly abetted the breakout.

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:17.880
In fact,

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:21.260
it is no exaggeration to say that
I was ringleader of the operation!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.390
I deeply apologize for holding my tongue this long!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.200
Yeah, I knew it.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.390
I thought it was all a little too strange.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:34.600
Hey, what are we gonna do
about this double-crosser?!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.520
Nothing, really.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:43.580
The Underground Student Council didn't find out that Gakuto assisted with the breakout.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.350
That's not the issue here!

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.450
Gakuto betrayed all of us, too!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:51.910
If it weren't for Kiyoshi helping me during this recent ant incident,

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:55.500
<i>I</i> would have made a lot more trouble for everyone.

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.260
I'm in no position to criticize Gakuto.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.500
Joe-dono...

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.150
Tch! Andre, what about you?

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.090
He's gotta pay, right?

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:06.800
I forgive Gakuto-kun, too.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.140
Are you guys for real?! How come?!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:12.870
Well, Gakuto-kun even went so far
as to destroy his precious figurine

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.270
so as not to create
any more trouble for us.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.460
I think he's been punished enough already.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.400
My deepest thanks...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.900
Would all of you guys stop
being so relaxed about this?!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:26.530
Gakuto is just as guilty as Kiyoshi is, you know!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.480
While we were out doing hard labor,

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.700
he was in the bathroom staring at his figurine, gloating to himself!

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.170
The bathroom?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.830
That figurine was in the bathroom?

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.370
Yeah, it was.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:40.160
How did you know that, Shingo?

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.580
The Underground Student Council members said so!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.300
Anyhow, I say Gakuto has to pay, got it?

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:50.950
Did they say that?

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:54.390
Shingo-kun's been with the vice president a lot lately,

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.100
maybe he heard it from her then.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.850
All alone with the vice president...

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:00.560
I'm so jealous.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.030
To be left like this, not allowed to receive punishment...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.490
Could the president have perceived naivety in me for thinking

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.670
that by accepting punishment, I would be forgiven?

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.000
Could my punishment be that I will not be punished?

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:17.830
President!

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:20.470
Oh, it's you, Hana.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.790
Um, the president said this is for you.

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:25.900
The president did?

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:27.880
This is...!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.970
Which one of you left this
shovel stuck in the ground?!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.260
Ah, I'm sorry, Vice President!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:37.560
Me! It was me!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.130
Andre-dono is definitely eager to receive his punishment, isn't he?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.270
Yeah, no doubt about th—

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:51.240
Vice... President...?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:54.410
Why is she dressed properly?

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:56.450
We cannot see her breasts or her panties.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:58.710
You left this shovel here?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.040
Ah, yes! It was me!

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.040
I will apologize by licking your boots!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.070
What's this?!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:05.130
He's going for a whip-cracking over a boot-licking?

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.800
He will likely get a smart blow for that.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.290
Hurry up and put it away.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.420
No way...

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.180
Your glasses are on crooked!

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:16.220
Gah!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:19.230
Why won't she use her crop on me?

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.690
No, wait! Don't give up yet!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.840
Mom! Er, I mean, Vice President!

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:25.070
I put the shovel away!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.300
That was the "accidental mom" phenomenon!

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:32.070
He's pulling the move where you call a teacher <i>mom</i> by mistake on the vice president?!

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.320
This will earn him a stinging blow!

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:35.020
Did you?

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:36.410
I don't get one?!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.440
My Slave Diary.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:42.280
Even my all-out "accidental mom" plan completely fell through.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:42.920
Boo-hoo-hoo.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.180
The president told me to wear this uniform,

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.730
one size too small for me...

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.560
But it's practically a strait jacket for me.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:01.690
However, as the punishment given to me by the president for my foolishness,

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.480
I must live with it.

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:07.650
Which one of you left this hoe stuck in the ground?!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.110
It was Andre-kun!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.040
I stuck it there for you.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.490
Go get your whipping.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.910
Yes! It was me!

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.550
First the shovel, and now the hoe, too!

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:17.950
I'm so hopeless!
I deserve to be whipped!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.910
Put it away at once.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:22.170
My Slave Diary.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.270
I didn't get a whipping today, either.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.630
I didn't get to capitalize on the chance Joe-kun set up for me, so I feel bad.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.080
What's the matter, Meiko-chan?!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.690
Do you feel ill?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.310
Chiyo-san...

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:41.950
I'll leave a glass of water here for you.

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:45.510
Isn't that uniform a little small for you?

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:47.310
No! It's just fine!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.850
I feel much better now.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:50.980
Really?

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:53.030
You should lie down a little while longer.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.370
"DTO"?

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.000
I think I'll drink some water.

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:05.790
What is this?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.000
Dog Transferral?

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.250
Oh, Chiyo...

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:13.160
What's the matter?

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.170
What brings you here?

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:17.360
Meiko-chan looked like she wasn't feeling well.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.070
So, um...

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:20.840
I'll be going now.

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:24.390
My Slave Diary.

00:22:24.390 --> 00:22:25.180
It's hopeless.

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:26.290
Please whip me.

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:27.270
I can't take any more.

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:28.060
Please curse me.

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:29.250
I can't bear it any longer.

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:30.500
Pour your derision on me.

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:32.920
Why won't she do anything to me?

00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:33.800
I just don't know.

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:35.860
Everyone else gets their<i> punishment.</i>

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:37.280
I see.

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:40.150
Thank you very much, Vice President.

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:42.410
Did you find it instructive?

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:43.280
Yes.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:46.410
He's feeling quite embattled right now.

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:48.790
It appears that the time is at hand.

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:50.060
Tomorrow,

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:54.550
we will implement the final phase of DTO,
the Dog Transferral Operation.

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:56.930
Onee-chan...

00:24:36.580 --> 00:24:38.780
Next time on Prison School:

00:24:39.650 --> 00:24:40.890
"Andre's Diary."
